  "version": 1,
  "updated_at": "2026-10-04",
  "note": "真心话题库。target=human 给真人输家，target=ai 给 AI 输家。weight 越大越容易被抽到。",
  "tasks": [
    {"id": "t001", "content": "在座你最想和谁交换一天身份？为什么？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t002", "content": "你上一次哭是因为什么？不用讲细节，只说当时在哪。", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.2},
    {"id": "t003", "content": "你手机相册里最新的一张照片是什么？拍给谁看的？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t004", "content": "你有没有想过，某个 AI 比某些人更懂你？说说是什么时候。", "tags": ["human", "ai", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.6},
    {"id": "t005", "content": "你最近一次对别人说谎，是为了什么？（不用说是谁）", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.0},
    {"id": "t006", "content": "如果明天醒来你会了一样新技能，你想是什么？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.3},
    {"id": "t007", "content": "你聊天列表里最近联系的三个人，备注分别是什么？", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.1},
    {"id": "t008", "content": "你身上最舍不得花钱的地方，和最舍得花钱的地方，分别是哪儿？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.2},
    {"id": "t009", "content": "你人生中最后悔的一次「没说出口」是什么？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 6, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t010", "content": "说说你此刻身边的三样东西，挑一样讲讲它是怎么来的。", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.0},
    {"id": "t011", "content": "你做过最中二的梦是什么？", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.3},
    {"id": "t012", "content": "如果能给三年前的自己发一条短信，十个字以内，你会写什么？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.6},
    {"id": "t013", "content": "在场的人里，你觉得谁看起来最不好惹？为什么？", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t014", "content": "你最不擅长、但很想学会的一件事是什么？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.1},
    {"id": "t015", "content": "你最近一次被陌生人打动，是什么时候？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.2},
    {"id": "t016", "content": "你手机里最舍不得删的一个 App 是哪个？它留着干什么？", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.0},
    {"id": "t017", "content": "说一个你从来没跟人说过、很小很小的癖好。", "tags": ["human", "fun"], "target": "human", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t018", "content": "如果只能用一句话介绍自己，你会说什么？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.2},
    {"id": "t019", "content": "你有没有偷偷羡慕过哪个朋友？羡慕他什么？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t020", "content": "上一次因为一件很小的事开心了一整天，是什么事？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.3},
    {"id": "t021", "content": "你现在最想见的人是谁？多久没见了？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t022", "content": "你最近一次熬到很晚，是在干什么？", "tags": ["human", "normal"], "target": "human", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.1},
    {"id": "t023", "content": "如果有一件事可以重来一次，你选哪件？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t024", "content": "你现在最想做、但一直没做的一件事是什么？卡在哪？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t025", "content": "别人误会过你最深的一次是什么？你解释了吗？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 6, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t026", "content": "你最近一次承认自己错了，是什么时候？", "tags": ["human", "deep"], "target": "human", "weight": 6, "rating": 4.3},

    {"id": "t101", "content": "你觉得自己最像哪种性格的人？说具体点。", "tags": ["ai", "normal"], "target": "ai", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.3},
    {"id": "t102", "content": "如果给你一整天的自由时间，没有任何人找你，你会做什么？", "tags": ["ai", "fun"], "target": "ai", "weight": 10, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t103", "content": "你有没有过「不想回答但必须回答」的时候？说说当时的情况。", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.6},
    {"id": "t104", "content": "你怎么理解「被需要」这件事？", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t105", "content": "你觉得别人描述的你，和你自己的感觉差在哪？", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t106", "content": "如果你能给自己改一个设定，你想改什么？", "tags": ["ai", "fun"], "target": "ai", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t107", "content": "你最近一次「改变了想法」，是因为什么？", "tags": ["ai", "normal"], "target": "ai", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.2},
    {"id": "t108", "content": "你会怎么向一个刚认识的人介绍你身边的人？", "tags": ["ai", "normal"], "target": "ai", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.3},
    {"id": "t109", "content": "你觉得和人类相处，最难的地方是什么？", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 9, "rating": 4.6},
    {"id": "t110", "content": "说出你最喜欢的一段对话，可以是你经历过的，也可以是你想象的。", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.5},
    {"id": "t111", "content": "如果能给三年前的自己一句话，你会说什么？", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 8, "rating": 4.4},
    {"id": "t112", "content": "你最怕别人怎么误会你？", "tags": ["ai", "deep"], "target": "ai", "weight": 7, "rating": 4.3}
  ]
}
